    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21764" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">immūgio</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inm-</span></b> ), īvi or ĭi,
		4, v. n.
		inmugio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to bellow</i>, <i>roar</i>, or <i>resound in</i> or <i>at</i> (<b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">curvisque immugiit Aetna cavernis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 3, 674</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">procella Antennae immugit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					17, 257</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">maestoque immugit regia luctu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 11, 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">judicaturo Domino lugubre mundus immugiet,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hier. Ep. 14</span></i>
			.</div>
